{%- comment -%}
  R2-08 module 4 — fit note under the size selector. Tee: must contain "drop-shoulder" and "When in doubt, size up"
  (H-5 may reword around them). Hoodie: the Printful disclaimer, verbatim.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if product.type == 'Hoodie' -%}
  <p class="sayoji-size-note" data-sayoji-module="4">This hoodie runs small. For the perfect fit, we recommend ordering one size larger than your usual size.</p>
{%- else -%}
  <p class="sayoji-size-note" data-sayoji-module="4">Drop-shoulder, relaxed fit. When in doubt, size up.</p>
{%- endif -%}
